Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:46:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 10/14] Android: Add AndroidViewImplementation (SurfaceView
 backend for WebContent rendering)

- UI/Android/app/src/main/cpp/AndroidViewImplementation.{h,cpp}: Native WebView backend using ANativeWindow from Java SurfaceView
- Handles WebContent compositor frame submission, touch/key input events, IPC with WebContentProcess (stubs for now)
- LadybirdEngine.cpp: Wire nativeCreateWebView to ANativeWindow_fromSurface, create AndroidViewImplementation instance
- nativeLoadURL/nativeDestroyWebView call AndroidViewImplementation methods
- CMakeLists.txt: Link AndroidViewImplementation.cpp into libladybird_android.so when LADYBIRD_LINK_ENGINE=ON
- configure-android-engine.ps1: CMake configure script for root Ladybird build (AK/LibCore/LibWeb/LibJS), ready to run after vcpkg manifest completes

Bootstrap APK still builds (AndroidViewImplementation not linked yet). Full engine APK will be built after vcpkg manifest install finishes.
